# Pre-commit checks

Before any git commit (and before pushing), always:

1. Build to catch TypeScript errors:
   `bun run build --filter=@backend/api --filter=@frontend/web`
2. Run tests (API must use non-watch):
   `bun run --filter @backend/api test:run`

Only commit if both succeed. See also `AGENTS.md`.
